---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Teaching, tutoring and workshops"
  description="Physics and astronomy tutoring, guest lectures, workshops and organisational training in science and complex-topic communication."
>
  <div class="wrap page">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/work-with-me/">Work with me</a> / Teaching</nav>
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Teaching, tutoring and workshops</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Four different formats, for different groups. Here is what each one is, so you can ask for the right thing.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="route-grid">
      <article class="route" data-tone="sky">
        <h3>Individual tutoring</h3>
        <p>One-to-one help with physics, astronomy and science communication.</p>
        <p class="for"><strong>For:</strong> school, college and university students, and adult learners.</p>
        <p class="for"><strong>Format:</strong> online, or in person around Leicester.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="route" data-tone="sky">
        <h3>Guest lectures and talks</h3>
        <p>A single session on space science, sustainability, Earth observation or communicating research.</p>
        <p class="for"><strong>For:</strong> universities, schools, societies, community groups and conferences.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="route" data-tone="sky">
        <h3>Workshops</h3>
        <p>Practical, hands-on sessions on explaining complex topics: structure, plain language, and checking accuracy.</p>
        <p class="for"><strong>For:</strong> research groups, charities, networks and student societies.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="route" data-tone="sky">
        <h3>Organisational training</h3>
        <p>Tailored sessions that build communication and content skills inside a team.</p>
        <p class="for"><strong>For:</strong> teams in space, sustainability and science organisations. Larger programmes run through <a href="https://greenorbit.space">Green Orbit Digital</a>.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Subjects</h2>
      <ul class="plain-list">
        <li>Physics and astronomy</li>
        <li>Space science and sustainability</li>
        <li>Science communication and research communication</li>
        <li>Climate and Earth observation communication</li>
        <li>Digital communication and content strategy</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Practical details</h2>
      <dl class="facts">
        <dt>Where</dt><dd>Online across the UK and Europe. In person in Leicester and the East Midlands, and further afield by arrangement.</dd>
        <dt>Level</dt><dd>Tell me the course, exam board or audience when you enquire and I’ll confirm whether I’m the right person.</dd>
        <dt>Younger learners</dt><dd>Tutoring for under-18s is arranged through a parent, guardian or school. Ask about safeguarding arrangements before booking.</dd>
        <dt>Fees and availability</dt><dd>Quoted after a short conversation about what you need.</dd>
      </dl>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="bp" href="/contact/#teaching">Enquire about teaching, workshops or speaking</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
